mmunication issues, B may be less suitable than C. However, B's reliability and stress resilience are strong. We can weigh that.\n\nWe need to state our current vote: Candidate C. Provide reasoning: B's crew cooperation concerns and lack of communication evidence make it weaker than C, despite reliability. Also note that we still need more info on B's attention to detail (memory for numbers) but overall C remains best.\n\nThus public message: I agree with Agent 3 that C is strongest, but highlight B's profile and why still not surpass C. Also note that we still need to verify B's attention to detail, but given current evidence, C remains provisional recommendation.\n\nNow produce final output."}
